{"id":"G214","lema":"ἀλαλάζω","lemaStrong":"ἀλαλάζω","translit":"alalázō","pron":"","glosa":"","defStrong":"to vociferate, i.e. (by implication) to wail; figuratively, to clang","defKjv":"tinkle, wail","derivacion":"from ( a shout, \"halloo\");","veces":2,"versos":2,"refs":["Mr 5:38","1 Co 13:1"],"texto":"Textus Receptus (Scrivener 1894)"}